Package: ringbinder
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cosmoe, attr, hicolor-icon-theme, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: tabbed personal organizer
 Ringbinder is a ring-bound personal organizer: diary, tasks, contacts,
 calls, year planner, notes and anniversaries, each behind its own tab.
 A Hokku app.
